  "releaseNotes": "Added id keyword \"nextid\" to automatically assign a non existing id\nadded aliasing for _ref() calls. eg _ref(0) has alias \"player\"\nfixed decimal numbers not parsing correctly\nCustomValueProvider<T> now has a OnNull virtual method that by default returns null. so that a value of null from the serialized data is by default a actual null value, but can be overridden if desired",
